# Source documents live here but are never committed — they are large, often
# licensed, and belong to whoever published them. Only this file is tracked,
# which is also what keeps the directory itself in git.
#
# Drop .pdf / .txt / .md / .html files here and run a detection pass; see the
# "Ingestion engine" section of CLAUDE.md. Anything with another extension is
# ignored rather than failed.
#
# Note there is deliberately no README.md here: the local-directory source
# scans this directory, so a README would be ingested as if it were a source
# document.
*
!.gitignore
